{"id":"53c4cfcc285b1329","group":"29","path":"29/29-thm-imm-sze-full.md","title":"Immerman-Szelepcsényi定理完整版","display":"thm-imm-sze-full — Immerman-Szelepcsényi定理完整版","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-thm-imm-sze-full","aliases":["29-thm-imm-sze-full"],"display":"thm-imm-sze-full — Immerman-Szelepcsényi定理完整版","depends_on":["[[29-df-complexity-classes]]"],"source_locator":"Corollary 9.23 and proof, p.151, DjVu scan 166","source_basis":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；一般空间界的陈述及自适应配置计数证明已核对"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-thm-imm-sze-full"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-thm-imm-sze-full</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-imm-sze-full — Immerman-Szelepcsényi定理完整版"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Corollary 9.23 and proof, p.151, DjVu scan 166"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；一般空间界的陈述及自适应配置计数证明已核对"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>；资源界以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"O(\\cdot)\">\\(O(\\cdot)\\)</span> 计，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 为输入大小。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NSPACE},\\mathrm{co\\text{-}NSPACE}\">\\(\\mathrm{NSPACE},\\mathrm{co\\text{-}NSPACE}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2017fdd1c0072445\" href=\"?note=2017fdd1c0072445\" title=\"29-df-complexity-classes\">29-df-complexity-classes</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}imm\\text{-}sze\\text{-}full}\\vdash\\forall s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(\\forall n\\geq2\\;s(n)\\geq\\lceil\\log_2n\\rceil\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{NSPACE}[s(n)]=\\mathrm{co\\text{-}NSPACE}[s(n)]\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}imm\\text{-}sze\\text{-}full}\\vdash\\forall s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(\\forall n\\geq2\\;s(n)\\geq\\lceil\\log_2n\\rceil\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{NSPACE}[s(n)]=\\mathrm{co\\text{-}NSPACE}[s(n)]\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Corollary 9.23，印刷页 151、扫描页 166。原书明确说明无需预先知道 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s(n)\">\\(s(n)\\)</span>：从一个配置开始，自适应扩大界并计算可达配置数。因此本条恢复对任意至少对数级空间函数的陈述，不把空间可构造性附加为必要条件。已核对该推论的论证；核心非可达性计数构造依赖 Theorem 9.20，本次未逐式重验其全部不动点公式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-complexity-classes","status":"resolved","id":"2017fdd1c0072445","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-complexity-classes]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-complexity-classes","status":"resolved","id":"2017fdd1c0072445","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NSPACE},\\mathrm{co\\text{-}NSPACE}$ (see [[29-df-complexity-classes]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"O(\\cdot)","display":false},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NSPACE},\\mathrm{co\\text{-}NSPACE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}imm\\text{-}sze\\text{-}full}\\vdash\\forall s:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N\\;\\Bigl(\\forall n\\geq2\\;s(n)\\geq\\lceil\\log_2n\\rceil\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{NSPACE}[s(n)]=\\mathrm{co\\text{-}NSPACE}[s(n)]\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"s(n)","display":false}],"bytes":1373,"backlinks":[{"id":"0c4a176d21e633b8","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"取 [[29-thm-imm-sze-full]] 中 $s(n)=\\lceil\\log_2 n\\rceil$ 即得；与原书 NL 对补集封闭的陈述一致。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-201","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-thm-imm-sze-full]]"}],"outgoing":["2017fdd1c0072445"]}